al deployment of the Groq 3 LPX rack be online at Nebius by December 31, 2026, as confirmed by NVIDIA or Nebius?\nQ30 figure What total amount of cloud service agreement commitments to AI cloud partners, under arrangements requiring NVIDIA to purchase capacity not sold to third parties, will NVIDIA disclose as outstanding at FY2027 year-end (January 31, 2027) in the commitments note of its FY2027 Form 10-K?\nQ31 yes/no By NVIDIA's FY2027 year-end on January 31, 2027, will China's antitrust regulators have issued a formal decision concluding the investigation into NVIDIA's compliance with its Mellanox acquisition conditions, following the September 15, 2025 preliminary finding, as documented in a regulator announcement or NVIDIA 10-Q/10-K disclosure published by that date?\nQ32 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete its acquisition of Hugging Face by December 31, 2027, as confirmed by an NVIDIA filing or an official announcement of closing?\nQ33 figure How much total global venture capital funding will AI companies raise in calendar 2026, in USD, as reported in PitchBook's year-end global AI venture-funding data?\nQ34 yes/no Will the DOJ Antitrust Division or FTC take a publicly documented formal antitrust step concerning NVIDIA's revenue-sharing, credit-support or customer-financing arrangements by NVIDIA's FY2027 year-end on January 31, 2027?\nQ35 yes/no Will Nvidia have begun commercial production of the revived Rubin CPX GPUs by March 31, 2027, as confirmed by Nvidia disclosures or supply-chain reports available by that date?\nQ36 figure What is the USD amount of NVIDIA's reported investment in CoreWeave as of FY2027 year-end, as disclosed in NVIDIA's FY2027 Form 10-K and related investment disclosures?\nQ37 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete an equity investment in Thinking Machines Lab by December 31, 2027, as confirmed by NVIDIA's filings or an announcement from Thinking Machines Lab or its investors confirming NVIDIA's participation in a closed funding round?\nQ38 yes/no Will 