ce shares by December 31, 2026?\nQ11 figure What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2027?\nQ12 yes/no Will the French competition authority conclude its antitrust investigation into NVIDIA by January 31, 2027?\nQ13 yes/no Will NVIDIA begin shipping its Kyber NVL144 next-generation AI rack system by December 31, 2028?\nQ14 figure How much will NVIDIA’s supply-chain purchase commitments outstanding be at the end of FY2027?\nQ15 figure How much total CPU revenue will NVIDIA report for FY2027?\nQ16 yes/no Will the U.S. Senate pass the Remote Access Security Act by December 31, 2026?\nQ17 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete its planned $1 billion investment in NAVER Corp. by December 31, 2026?\nQ18 figure How much financing will NVIDIA have provided or committed to Amkor under the packaging expansion agreement by the FY2027 annual report?\nQ19 yes/no Will NVIDIA agree to provide the reported financing guarantee for OpenAI's southern Ohio data center project by January 31, 2027?\nQ20 yes/no Will NVIDIA agree to finance OpenAI chip purchases for the southern Ohio data center project by January 31, 2027?\nQ21 yes/no Will NVIDIA launch its Rosa next-generation CPU by December 31, 2028?\nQ22 yes/no Will Taiwan’s Ministry of Economic Affairs adopt performance-threshold export controls for advanced chips by January 31, 2027?\nQ23 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete the reported $5 billion investment in Safe Superintelligence by December 31, 2026?\nQ24 yes/no Will NVIDIA agree to provide a financing guarantee for OpenAI’s southern Ohio data center project by January 31, 2027?\nQ25 yes/no Will NVIDIA agree to finance OpenAI chip purchases for the southern Ohio data center project by January 31, 2027?\nQ26 yes/no Will Taiwan adopt a criminal ban on all AI chip exports to China by January 31, 2027?\nQ27 yes/no Will the U.S. Department of Commerce conclude its investigation into Chinese firms’ access to advanced U.S. chips by December 31, 2026?\nQ28 figure How much will NVIDIA’s committed equity-investment obligations to ecosystem partners total at the FY2027 annual report?\nQ29 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete final agreements for the announced institutional AI-infrastructure financing platforms by August 15, 2027?\nQ30 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete its planned $1.5 billion investment in SB Energy by December 31, 2026?\nQ31 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete its planned $1.5 billion investment in SB Energy by August 17, 2027?\nQ32 figure How much will NVIDIA’s outstanding payment obligation for the Poolside Model Factory license be at the FY2027 annual report?\nQ33 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete its reported $1 billion investment in Poolside by August 21, 2027?\nQ34 figure What gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2028?\nQ35 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete its reported acquisition of Hugging Face by August 26, 2027?\nQ36 figure How much financing will NVIDIA have provided to MediaTek through the announced convertible-bond investment by its FY2027 annual report?\nQ37 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete its $3.5 billion investment in MediaTek by February 28, 2027?\nQ38 figure How much will NVIDIA’s MediaTek convertible-bond purchase obligation amount to at the FY2027 annual report?\nQ39 yes/no Will NVIDIA agree to invest in Thinking Machines Lab's reported funding round by September 4, 2027?\nQ40 figure How much will NVIDIA's total revenue grow year over year in FY2028?\nQ41 yes/no Will the Federal Reserve raise its policy rate at its September 15–16, 2026 meeting?\nQ42 figure How much Networking revenue will NVIDIA report for FY2027?\nQ43 yes/no Will the Department of Justice issue a formal enforcement decision on NVIDIA’s Groq deal by September 10, 2027?\nQ44 figure How much Vera CPU revenue will NVIDIA report for FY2028?\nQ45 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete an investment in Anthropic’s potential IPO by September 14, 2027?\nQ46 yes/no Will NVIDIA agree to invest $10 billion in Anthropic’s IPO by September 20, 2026?\nQ47 yes/no Will NVIDIA complete its acquisition of Hugging Face by June 30, 2027?\n[('matters', 'list', 32), ('matter_first_day', 'dict', 32), ('mapping', 'dict', 5), ('distinct', 'dict', 5), ('cards', 'dict', 5), ('controls', 'dict', 3), ('inputs', 'dict', 7)]\nTypeError: unhashable type: 'slice'\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
