 2026 capital expenditure What will Amazon, Alphabet, Microsoft and Meta spend in aggregate on capital expenditures in calendar 2026?\nM05 False Worldwide semiconductor sales in 2026 What will worldwide semiconductor sales be in calendar 2026?\nM06 True NVIDIA FY2027 data-center revenue What is NVIDIA's data-center revenue in FY2027?\nM07 True NVIDIA FY2028 data-center revenue What will NVIDIA's data-center revenue be in FY2028?\nM08 False NVIDIA future investment commitments at FY2027 year-end How much are NVIDIA's outstanding future investment commitments at FY2027 year-end?\nM09 True NVIDIA FY2027 data-center networking revenue What is NVIDIA's data-center networking revenue in FY2027?\nM10 True NVIDIA FY2028 non-GAAP gross margin What will NVIDIA's non-GAAP gross margin be in FY2028?\nM11 True NVIDIA FY2028 total revenue What will NVIDIA's total revenue be in FY2028?\nM12 False NVIDIA OpenAI Ohio lease guarantee at FY2027 year-end What amount of NVIDIA's financial backstop for OpenAI's SB Energy Ohio data-center lease remains outstanding at FY2027 year-end?\nM13 False NVIDIA supply and capacity purchase commitments at FY2027 year-end How much will NVIDIA's outstanding supply and capacity purchase commitments total at the end of FY2027?\nM14 False Combined calendar-2027 capex of Amazon, Microsoft, Alphabet and Meta amid AI-slowdown debate What combined calendar-2027 capital expenditure will Amazon, Microsoft, Alphabet and Meta report, compared with 2026?\nM15 False Whether China formally permits imports of NVIDIA data center chips (H200) by 2027-01-31 Will China's government formally permit domestic companies to import NVIDIA H200/data center chips by 2027-01-31 (researcher-set check date: NVIDIA FY2027 year-end)?\nM16 False Calendar-2027 average DRAM (incl. HBM) contract price change vs 2026 Will 2027 average DRAM contract prices be higher than, flat with, or lower than 2026, and by how much?\nM17 False Whether NVIDIA commits an up-to-$10B anchor investment in Anthropic's IPO Will NVIDIA sign or fund an anchor investment of about $10B in Anthropic's IPO by 2027-03-14 (researcher-set check date), and if so of what size?\nM18 True NVIDIA FY2027 gross margin under memory-cost pressure (Q3 guide 74%, Q4 71-72%) What full-year non-GAAP gross margin will NVIDIA report for FY2027 (ending January 2027), given guides of 74% in Q3 and 71-72% in Q4?\nM19 False Whether NVIDIA closes the ~$12.9B Hugging Face acquisition (incl. regulatory clearance) Will NVIDIA complete its ~$12.9B acquisition of Hugging Face, including US/EU regulatory clearance, by 2027-06-30 (end of the company's H1 2027 close target)?\nM20 False Whether NVIDIA signs up to $125B residual-value support for Goldman Sachs/Blackstone AI infrastructure partnerships Will NVIDIA sign residual-value support agreements (up to $125B) for the Goldman Sachs/Blackstone AI infrastructure partnerships by 2027-03-31 (researcher-set check date)?\nM21 False Alphabet 2026 capital expenditure What is Alphabet's capital expenditure in fiscal 2026?\nM22 False Broadcom FY2026 AI semiconductor revenue What will Broadcom's AI semiconductor revenue be in FY2026?\nM23 False CoreWeave fiscal 2026 revenue What will CoreWeave's total revenue be in fiscal 2026?\nM24 False Five major hyperscalers' combined 2026 data-center capital expenditure What will combined 2026 data-center capital expenditure be for the five largest AI hyperscalers?\nM25 False DOJ enforcement over NVIDIA's Groq arrangement By January 31, 2027, will the U.S. Department of Justice bring an antitrust enforcement action over NVIDIA's Groq arrangement?\nM26 False EU regulatory review of the Hugging Face acquisition By January 31, 2027, what stage will EU regulatory review of NVIDIA's Hugging Face acquisition have reached?\nM27 False NVIDIA Hugging Face acquisition obligation at FY2027 year-end How much of NVIDIA's agreed Hugging Face acquisition obligation remains outstanding at FY2027 year-end?\nM28 False U.S. antitrust review of the Hugging Face acquisition By January 31, 2027, what stage will U.S. antitrust review of NVIDIA's Hugging Face acquisition have reached?\nM29 False Marvell FY2028 revenue What will Marvell's total revenue be in FY2028?\nM30 True NVIDIA FY2028 Vera CPU revenue How much revenue will NVIDIA generate from Vera CPUs in FY2028?\nM31 False NVIDIA AI cloud partner guarantee obligations at FY2027 year-end / NVIDIA total third-party guarantees and credit support for cloud/AI partners in the FY2027 10-K (vs up to $108.5B) How much will NVIDIA report in guarantee obligations tied to AI cloud partners in its FY2027 annual report?\nM32 False NVIDIA neocloud capacity commitments at FY2027 year-end / NVIDIA cloud-service/neocloud capacity commitments, take-or-pay and revenue-floor backstops in the FY2027 10-K (vs $36B) How much will NVIDIA's outstanding neocloud cloud-service commitments total at FY2027 year-end?\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
